### Health Check
GET http://localhost:4000/api/health

### Google OAuth Consent Flow (Browser navigation)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/google

### Get Current User Profile (Session Required)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/me

### Logout
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/logout

### Get Senders
GET http://localhost:4000/api/senders

### Schedule Email Batch
POST http://localhost:4000/api/emails/schedule
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderId": "sender-uuid-placeholder",
  "subject": "Follow up on our meeting",
  "bodyHtml": "<p>Hey there,</p><p>Great connecting with you. Let me know if you are open for a quick demo this week.</p><p>Best,<br>Oliver</p>",
  "recipients": [
    "sarah.connor@example.com",
    "john.doe@example.com",
    "john.doe@example.com"
  ],
  "startTime": "2026-10-16T20:00:00.000Z",
  "delayBetweenEmailsSeconds": 5,
  "hourlyLimit": 50
}

### Get Scheduled Emails (Paginated, Searchable)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/emails/scheduled?page=1&limit=20&q=demo

### Get Sent Emails (Paginated, Searchable)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/emails/sent?page=1&limit=20&q=

### Get Email Counts (Scheduled & Sent)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/emails/counts

### Get Email Detail by ID
GET http://localhost:4000/api/emails/email-uuid-placeholder

### Get Slack Connection Status
GET http://localhost:4000/api/slack/status

### Connect Slack OAuth (Browser navigation)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/slack/connect

### Disconnect Slack
POST http://localhost:4000/api/slack/disconnect
